      <div type="clause" n="35">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VAtr">V Atr</ref> 35</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ uton ænne cynehlaford holdlice healdan ⁊ lif ⁊ land samod ealle werian, swa wel swa we betst magon, ⁊ God ælmihtigne inweardre heortan fultumes biddan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And let us loyally support one royal lord, and all of us together defend our lives and our country, to the best of our ability, and from our inmost heart pray to God Almighty for help.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ utan ænne cynehlaford holdlice healdan ⁊ lif ⁊ land samod ealle werian, swa wel swa we betst magan, ⁊ God ealmihtigne inwerdre heortan fultumes biddan.</ab>
      </div>
